---
config:
  flowchart:
    nodeSpacing: 150
    rankSpacing: 80
  themeVariables:
    edgeLabelBackground: 'transparent'
---
flowchart TD
    Start([vigilo run create])

    Sources{Profile and dataset sources valid?}
    Parse{Profile and dataset schemas valid?}
    Cases{Dataset has cases?}
    Executable{Profile executable for dataset?}
    Plan[Plan case, dataset, run, chunks, and shard assignments]
    Persist[Commit creating run, frozen membership hashes, ledger, and chunk plan]
    Placement{Pending placement remains?}
    Seed[Idempotently seed the placement]
    SeedResult{Seed result?}
    Record[Record placement seeded]
    Activate[Create dispatch cursors, set pending, and remove temporary plan; retain membership hashes]
    Payload[Build run creation payload]

    Success([Success response])
    Creating([Creating response for coordinator recovery])
    CreationFailed([Failed run response])

    SourceFail([Input source error])
    ParseFail([Input schema error])
    EmptyDatasetFail([Empty dataset error])
    ExecutabilityFail([Executability validation error])
    PlanningFail([Run planning error])
    PersistenceFail([Persistence error])

    Start --> Sources

    Sources -- No --> SourceFail
    Sources -- Yes --> Parse

    Parse -- No --> ParseFail
    Parse -- Yes --> Cases

    Cases -- No --> EmptyDatasetFail
    Cases -- Yes --> Executable

    Executable -- No --> ExecutabilityFail
    Executable -- Yes --> Plan

    Plan --> Persist
    Plan -. Planning fails .-> PlanningFail

    Persist --> Placement
    Persist -. Transaction fails .-> PersistenceFail

    Placement -- Yes --> Seed
    Seed --> SeedResult
    SeedResult -- Committed --> Record --> Placement
    SeedResult -- Retryable failure --> Creating
    SeedResult -- Persisted-data conflict --> CreationFailed
    Placement -- No --> Activate
    Activate --> Payload
    Activate -. Retryable failure .-> Creating

    Payload --> Success

    class Start command
    class Success success
    class Sources,Parse,Cases,Executable,Plan,Persist,Placement,Seed,SeedResult,Record,Activate,Payload system
    class Creating component
    class SourceFail,ParseFail,EmptyDatasetFail,ExecutabilityFail,PlanningFail,PersistenceFail,CreationFailed error
